# Fleeting Reflection targets: the first must be a creature you control (Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot1's Mox Jet are refused), the
# second an "other" creature (not the first one, not a Mox) that may be anyone's. It costs {1}{U}: Mox Jet and Mox Ruby make two mana but no
# blue, which is refused; with an Island it is paid. Memnite#2 is accepted as the second target (an own creature).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Memnite
Memnite
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Fleeting Reflection
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x15

